scn 1
# Gap sweep (the audit's `auditgaps`: pinwheelRun for gaps 6/8/10/14/20), five
# corridors stacked in one 200x700 map, 140 rows each: the pinwheel U-turn's wall
# (x 98-101, z 48 to the bottom of the corridor) with a second wall above its end
# (x 98-101, z 0 to 48-gap) leaving a gap of GAP cells. Each corridor holds one
# group of 48 footprint-2 bodies (8 per row, x 40-61) sent to (150, 110) of its
# corridor; a 1-cell wall closes each corridor's bottom. Orders are two ticks apart
# so each selection (48 commands) lands in one tick. Gate gGAP is the 8-cell strip
# over the gap (x 97-104), side keys are global, so read per-group g.<name>.* for
# progress and gate.<name>.* for files.
# Source (main b8a4110, each gap alone in its own world, offset 0):
#   gap  6: rounded90 1930 done 3346 files 1.15   gap  8: 1930 3346 1.15 (identical to 6)
#   gap 10: rounded90 1314 done 2610 files 4.14   gap 14: 1332 2934 3.98
#   gap 20: rounded90 1252 done 2284 files 4.48
# Stacked (offset 0): gap 6 done 3347 files 1.15 and gap 10 done 2607 reproduce
# the lone runs; gap 8 3609, gap 14 2666 and gap 20 2649 (lone 2284) do not, the
# five groups sharing one navigator and field quota. Report-only for those.
# Gap 8 is as narrow as 6 for 2x2 bodies: the footprint-origin plane holds 7 origins.
name gapsweep
ticks 5000
seed 7
map flat 200 700
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
wall 98 48 4 91
wall 98 0 4 42
wall 0 139 200 1
wall 98 188 4 91
wall 98 140 4 40
wall 0 279 200 1
wall 98 328 4 91
wall 98 280 4 38
wall 0 419 200 1
wall 98 468 4 91
wall 98 420 4 34
wall 0 559 200 1
wall 98 608 4 91
wall 98 560 4 28
wall 0 699 200 1
group G6 0 m 48 rect 40 96 64 114 pitch=3
group G8 0 m 48 rect 40 236 64 254 pitch=3
group G10 0 m 48 rect 40 376 64 394 pitch=3
group G14 0 m 48 rect 40 516 64 534 pitch=3
group G20 0 m 48 rect 40 656 64 674 pitch=3
gate g6 101 0 101 47
gate g8 101 140 101 187
gate g10 101 280 101 327
gate g14 101 420 101 467
gate g20 101 560 101 607
at 1 move G6 150 110
at 3 move G8 150 250
at 5 move G10 150 390
at 7 move G14 150 530
at 9 move G20 150 670
